I used to blank without a budget.

92
00:05:18.219 --> 00:05:21.861
A, spend. B, spending. C, spent.

93
00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.678
The answer is A: spend.

94
00:05:28.817 --> 00:05:32.244
Money saved for surprise problems is an emergency blank.

95
00:05:32.544 --> 00:05:36.012
A, fund. B, debt. C, asset.

96
00:05:39.567 --> 00:05:41.485
The answer is A: fund.

97
00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.789
Careful not to waste money is blank.

98
00:05:45.089 --> 00:05:48.649
A, frugal. B, generous. C, wealthy.

99
00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.898
The answer is A: frugal.

100
00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.623
